  "Software Details": "Softwaredetails",
  "Effortlessly manage your restaurant's menu with Dash SaaS. Our intuitive interface allows you to create, edit, and organize menu items with ease. Whether you're updating prices, and descriptions, or adding new dishes, everything can be done in just a few clicks. Say goodbye to difficult menu management processes and hello to an effortless experience that saves you time and effort.": "Verwalten Sie mühelos die Speisekarte Ihres Restaurants mit Dash SaaS. ",
  "/Month": "/Monat",
  "/Year": "/Jahr",
  "Buy Now": "Jetzt kaufen",
  "View Live Demo": "Live-Demo ansehen",
  "Dynamic Offers and Promotions": "Dynamische Angebote und Werbeaktionen",
  "Boost your sales and attract more customers with our offers management feature. With Dash SaaS, creating and managing special promotions has never been easier. From happy hour deals to seasonal discounts, you can set up and customize offers to suit your restaurant`s needs. Watch as your promotions drive traffic and increase revenue, all from within the convenience of our platform.": "Steigern Sie Ihren Umsatz und gewinnen Sie mehr Kunden mit unserer Angebotsverwaltungsfunktion. ",
  "Efficient Table Arrangements": "Effiziente Tischanordnung",
  "Optimize your dining space and streamline your operations with our table arrangement feature. Easily set up and modify table layouts, assign reservations, and keep track of available seating. With Dash SaaS, managing your restaurant`s floor plan has never been easier, allowing you to maximize efficiency and provide a seamless dining experience for your guests.": "Optimieren Sie Ihren Essbereich und optimieren Sie Ihre Abläufe mit unserer Tischanordnungsfunktion. ",
  "Customization and Real-time Updates": "Anpassung und Echtzeit-Updates",
  "Tailor your menu to fit your restaurant`s unique identity with our attribute and category creation tools. Whether you`re creating tags like \"spicy\" or \"vegetarian\" or organizing items into categories like \"appetizers\" and \"desserts,\" you have complete control over how your menu is presented. Plus, with instant front-end updates, any changes you make are immediately visible to your customers, ensuring that they always have access to the most current information.": "Passen Sie Ihr Menü mit unseren Tools zur Erstellung von Attributen und Kategorien an die einzigartige Identität Ihres Restaurants an. ",
  "Enhanced Customer Engagement": "Verbesserte Kundenbindung",
  "Take your customer service to the next level with our customer management tools. Add new customers to your database and store valuable information such as contact details and dining preferences. With this data at your fingertips, you can provide personalized recommendations and tailored experiences that keep your customers coming back for more.": "Bringen Sie Ihren Kundenservice mit unseren Kundenmanagement-Tools auf die nächste Stufe. ",
  "Real-time Frontend Updates": "Frontend-Updates in Echtzeit",
  "With Dash SaaS, any changes you make to your menu, offers, or dining table arrangements are instantly visible on the front end. Whether you`re updating prices, creating new offers, or adjusting dining table layouts, your customers will always have access to the most up-to-date information. Say goodbye to manual updates and hello to a seamlessly integrated experience for both you and your customers.": "Mit Dash SaaS sind alle Änderungen, die Sie an Ihrer Speisekarte, Angeboten oder Esstischanordnung vornehmen, sofort im Frontend sichtbar. ",
  "Why choose dedicated modules": "Warum dedizierte Module wählen?",
  "for your business?": "für Ihr Unternehmen?",
  "With Dash, you can conveniently manage all your business functions from a single location": "Mit Dash können Sie alle Ihre Geschäftsfunktionen bequem von einem einzigen Ort aus verwalten",
  "Empower Your Workforce with DASH": "Stärken Sie Ihre Belegschaft mit DASH",
